  <entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_IntangibleAssetsCompletedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_EsomezolDrSrCap10MgMemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">기존 에소메졸DR서방캡슐 20mg / 40mg 과 동일한 제제기술을 적용한 에스오메프라졸마그네슘 10mg 저함량 제품(위염 치료제)으로 2022년 12월에 국내 발매완료되었으며 상각기간 5년을 적용하여 상각비를 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_IntangibleAssetsCompletedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_ClosartanTab50625MgMemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">고혈압 치료제인 기존 클로잘탄정(로사르탄/클로르탈리돈)의 저용량 복합제로서, 2023년 7월에 국내 발매완료되었으며 상각기간 5년을 적용하여 상각비를 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_IntangibleAssetsCompletedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_AmoprelTabMemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1기 고혈압 환자 대상 1차 요법으로 처방하기 위한 암로디핀/로사르탄/클로르탈리돈 조합의 복합제로서 2025년 8월에 국내 발매완료되었으며 상각기간 5년을 적용하여 상각비를 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_IntangibleAssetsCompletedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_DexibuprofenOralSuspensionMemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">D-이부프로펜 구강 현탁액은 비스테로이드성 소염진통제로서 중국에서 2023년 11월에 발매완료되었으며, 상각기간 5년을 적용하여 상각비를 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems>
