  <entity00828497:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationBonusIssueOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationLineItemsOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" unitRef="SHARES" decimals="INF">19403</entity00828497:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationBonusIssueOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationLineItemsOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationStandardOfKeyManagementPersonnelOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationLineItemsOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedMember_ifrs-full_CarryingAmountAccumulatedDepreciationAmortisationAndImpairmentAndGrossCarryingAmountAxis_dart_ReportedAmountMember" xml:lang="ko">연결회사는 등기이사 및 기업활동의 계획, 운영 및 통제에 대한 중요한 권한과 책임을가진 등기 임원을 주요 경영진으로 판단하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:KeyManagementPersonnelCompensationStandardOfKeyManagementPersonnelOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationLineItemsOfDisclosureOfKeyManagementPersonnelCompensationTableOfItems>
