  <ifrs-full:ExplanationOfMainEventsAndCircumstancesThatLedToRecognitionOfImpairmentLossesAndReversalsOfImpairmentLosses contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_DiscontinuedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfDetailsOfImpairmentLossOfMajorDevelopmentExpenseTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_Hcp2102MemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfDetailsOfImpairmentLossOfMajorDevelopmentExpenseTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">고혈압 치료제인 기존 아모잘탄플러스정(암로디핀/로사르탄/클로르탈리돈)의 저용량 복합제로서, 회사 내부 방침에 따라 개발을 중단하기로 하여 2024년에 전액 손상차손 인식하였습니다.</ifrs-full:ExplanationOfMainEventsAndCircumstancesThatLedToRecognitionOfImpairmentLossesAndReversalsOfImpairmentLosses>
