  <entity00828497:CarryingAmountsOfTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">19615000000</entity00828497:CarryingAmountsOfTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:CarryingAmountsOfTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025eFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" unitRef="KRW" decimals="-6">2766000000</entity00828497:CarryingAmountsOfTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:LineItemsInWichTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">공급자 금융약정과 관련된 금융부채는 재무상태표상 매입채무및기타채무에 포함되어 있습니다. 회사는 공급자금융약정에 따라 금융기관에게 지급해야 할 금액은 회사의 정상영업주기 내에 사용되는 운전자본의 일부로서 매입채무및기타채무와 유사한 성격과 기능을지니고 있다고 판단하여 이를 매입채무및기타채무로 분류하고, 투자활동에 해당하는유형자산 취득 관련 지출을 제외하고는 관련 현금흐름을 영업활동현금흐름으로 분류하고 있습니다. 회사는 공급자금융약정에 따라 지급해야 할 금액을 회사의 일반 매입채무및기타채무에 포함하여 유동성위험을 분석하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:LineItemsInWichTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfTheTermsAndConditionsOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 이 거래로 인해 금융기관에 추가적인 이자를 부담하지 않으며, 관련하여 담보를 제공하고 있지 않습니다. 또한 이와 관련된 연장지급조건은 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfTheTermsAndConditionsOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfRangeOfPaymentDueDatesForBothTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementAndComparableTradePayablesThatAreNotPartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">공급자금융약정에 해당하는 금융부채와 공급자금융약정에 해당하지 않는 금융부채의 지급기일에는 유의적인 차이가 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfRangeOfPaymentDueDatesForBothTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementAndComparableTradePayablesThatAreNotPartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:LineItemsInWichTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">공급자 금융약정과 관련된 금융부채는 재무상태표상 매입채무및기타채무에 포함되어 있습니다. 회사는 공급자금융약정에 따라 금융기관에게 지급해야 할 금액은 회사의 정상영업주기 내에 사용되는 운전자본의 일부로서 매입채무및기타채무와 유사한 성격과 기능을지니고 있다고 판단하여 이를 매입채무및기타채무로 분류하고, 투자활동에 해당하는유형자산 취득 관련 지출을 제외하고는 관련 현금흐름을 영업활동현금흐름으로 분류하고 있습니다. 회사는 공급자금융약정에 따라 지급해야 할 금액을 회사의 일반 매입채무및기타채무에 포함하여 유동성위험을 분석하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:LineItemsInWichTheFinancialLiabilitiesDisclosedUnderSupplierFinanceArrangementForWhichSuppliersHaveAlreadyReceivedPaymentFromTheFinanceProvidersOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfTheTermsAndConditionsOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">회사는 이 거래로 인해 금융기관에 추가적인 이자를 부담하지 않으며, 관련하여 담보를 제공하고 있지 않습니다. 또한 이와 관련된 연장지급조건은 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfTheTermsAndConditionsOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
  <entity00828497:DescriptionOfRangeOfPaymentDueDatesForBothTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementAndComparableTradePayablesThatAreNotPartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems contextRef="PFY2024dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_dart_TypesOfCommitmentsAxis_entity00828497_SupplierFinanceArrangementsMemberOfTypesOfCommitmentsMemberOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">공급자금융약정에 해당하는 금융부채와 공급자금융약정에 해당하지 않는 금융부채의 지급기일에는 유의적인 차이가 없습니다.</entity00828497:DescriptionOfRangeOfPaymentDueDatesForBothTheFinancialLiabilitiesThatArePartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementAndComparableTradePayablesThatAreNotPartOfASupplierFinanceArrangementOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsLineItemsOfDisclosureOfSupplierFinanceArrangementsTableOfItems>
