  <entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems contextRef="CFY2025dFY_ifrs-full_ConsolidatedAndSeparateFinancialStatementsAxis_ifrs-full_SeparateMember_ifrs-full_ClassesOfIntangibleAssetsOtherThanGoodwillAxis_ifrs-full_CapitalisedDevelopmentExpenditureMember_dart_PhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_IntangibleAssetsCompletedMemberOfPhaseForResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember_dart_IndividualAssetForBioindustryAxis_entity00828497_AmoprelTabMemberOfIndividualAssetForBioindustryMemberOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfMember" xml:lang="ko">1기 고혈압 환자 대상 1차 요법으로 처방하기 위한 암로디핀/로사르탄/클로르탈리돈 조합의 복합제로서, 2025년 8월에 국내 발매완료되었으며 상각기간 5년을 적용하여 상각비를 계상하고 있습니다.</entity00828497:DetailsOfDevelopmentExpenseOfAccumulatedCapitalisedResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryLineItemsOfResearchAndDevelopmentExpenseForBioindustryTableOfItems>
